  "note": "The origin of the animal name is separate from the question of speech or movement in Sng 7:10. The Akkadian comparisons leave open whether Hebrew borrowed the report noun. The siege term is a marginal reading whose first element and relationship to this root are uncertain. SEDRA lexeme 638 identifies the Syriac bear in Rev 13:2."
